  "bio": "Bill Kaufmann, the esteemed owner and artist at Pearl City Tattoo Lounge in Muscatine, Iowa, is renowned for his exceptional talent in a range of styles including illustrative, watercolor, trashpolka, and coverups. With the inception of his studio in 2006, Bill has consistently upheld the highest standards of cleanliness, ensuring a safe and sterile environment for all his clients. This commitment to hygiene, combined with his artistic prowess, makes Bill a trustworthy choice for anyone seeking a high-quality tattoo experience.\nPrice: $\nCurrent location: Muscatine, Iowa, United States"
